---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import EditorialNote from '../../components/seo/EditorialNote.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free Resume Summary Generator — No Sign-up" description="Turn your own role, skills, and factual achievements into an editable resume summary. Free, private, browser-based drafting with no AI service or account."><div class="page-wrap article"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FACTS. A CLEARER START.</span><h1>Resume summary generator.</h1><p>Enter what is true about your experience. This local tool arranges your facts into a short draft; it does not invent qualifications or use an AI service.</p></header><form id="summary-form" class="summary-form"><label class="field-label">Professional focus<input class="field" id="summary-role" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Data analyst"/></label><label class="field-label">Relevant skills<input class="field" id="summary-skills" required maxlength="250" placeholder="SQL, Python, and operational reporting"/></label><label class="field-label">One factual contribution<textarea class="field" id="summary-evidence" required maxlength="500" rows="3" placeholder="Automated weekly reporting, saving the team 12 hours per month"></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="summary-starter"/> I am entering this field; describe my goal without claiming experience.</label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Draft my summary</button></form><section class="seo-section"><h2>Your editable draft</h2><textarea id="summary-result" class="field summary-result" rows="5" aria-label="Generated summary" placeholder="Your draft will appear here."></textarea><div class="seo-actions"><button id="copy-summary" class="button secondary" disabled>Copy summary</button><a class="button primary" href="/builder/">Open the resume editor ↗</a></div><p id="summary-status" role="status" class="hint"></p><p>Review every sentence. Copy the text into the editor's Summary section. The tool does not save these fields or send them to a server.</p></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>What makes a useful summary?</h2><p>State your focus, select skills relevant to the job, and add evidence you can discuss. Avoid generic superlatives and unsupported measurements. If you are changing careers, distinguish your existing experience from the role you want.</p><div class="topic-links"><a href="/advice/resume-summary/">Summary examples and writing advice</a></div></section><EditorialNote/></div></Layout>
<script>
import {draftSummary} from '../../lib/summary-generator';
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#summary-form')!;
const result=document.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#summary-result')!;
const copy=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy-summary')!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#summary-status')!;
form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();try{result.value=draftSummary((document.querySelector('#summary-role') as HTMLInputElement).value,(document.querySelector('#summary-skills') as HTMLInputElement).value,(document.querySelector('#summary-evidence') as HTMLTextAreaElement).value,(document.querySelector('#summary-starter') as HTMLInputElement).checked);copy.disabled=false;status.textContent='Draft ready. Edit it for accuracy and fit.';}catch(e){status.textContent=(e as Error).message;}});
result.addEventListener('input',()=>copy.disabled=!result.value.trim());
copy.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(result.value);status.textContent='Copied. Paste it into the editor’s Summary section.';}catch{result.focus();result.select();status.textContent='Select and copy the draft with your keyboard.';}});
</script>
